    "**Q24.** Which of the following, if true, would most strongly support the passage's overall argument?",
    "A) Storage costs have risen sharply for a decade B) A mixed grid stayed stable through a low-wind week C) A country's only solar farm went offline for a month D) Coal plants need no maintenance downtime at all",
