    "A) Aarav B) Bhavna C) Chetan D) Esha",
    "<details><summary>Answer & explanation</summary>",
    "",
    "**Correct: D)** Scan the pages column: 150, 175, 125, 150, 200. The largest single number in this list is 200, and that row belongs to **Esha**. Option B (Bhavna, 175) is the second-highest and is the usual trap for a reader who stops scanning one row too early. Always compare every value in the column before picking the maximum.",
