    "### 🧩 Five friends in a row",
    "",
    "Five friends — Rohan, Sana, Tarun, Uma and Vikram — sit in a row of five chairs numbered 1 to 5 from left to right, all facing north (so \"left\" and \"right\" below mean the reader's left and right as drawn). The following is known:",
