    "",
    "**Correct: C)** Using the full seating order from Q25 — Uma (1), Sana (2), Rohan (3), Tarun (4), Vikram (5) — the middle seat of a row of five is seat 3, which is occupied by **Rohan**. Option D (Tarun) is one seat to the right of the middle; it is a common slip to picture \"second from the right\" (seat 4) as if it were the exact middle.",
