    "### 🧩 Favourite fruit and favourite colour",
    "",
    "Four friends — Ira, Jatin, Kavya and Lohit — each has exactly one favourite fruit (Apple, Banana, Mango, Papaya — no two friends share a fruit) and exactly one favourite colour (Red, Yellow, Green, Orange — no two friends share a colour). The following is known:",
