    "A) Apple B) Banana C) Mango D) Papaya",
    "<details><summary>Answer & explanation</summary>",
    "",
    "**Correct: D)** Ira has Mango (clue 1) and Lohit has Banana (clue 2), so only Apple and Papaya remain for Jatin and Kavya. Clue 3 says Jatin's fruit is not Papaya, so Jatin must have **Apple**, which leaves **Papaya** for Kavya. Option A (Apple) is actually Jatin's fruit, the easiest slip when a clue is stated as a negative (\"not Papaya\") rather than a positive fact.",
