    "### 🧩 Tea and coffee at Sunrise Office",
    "",
    "Sunrise Office has 100 employees. A survey found that 55 employees drink tea, 40 employees drink coffee, and 20 employees drink both tea and coffee. Every employee drinks tea, coffee, both, or neither.",
    "",
