    "",
    "**Q136.** How many of the seven colleagues are taller than the person standing in position 1?",
    "A) 2 B) 3 C) 4 D) 5",
    "<details><summary>Answer & explanation</summary>",
    "",
    "**Correct: B)** Position 1 is Chandni, height 160 cm. Compare every other height to 160: Aisha 165 (taller), Gaurav 158 (shorter), Bilal 180 (taller), Farah 145 (shorter), Dev 173 (taller), Hema 150 (shorter). Exactly three people — Aisha, Bilal and Dev — are taller than Chandni, giving **3**.",
